'''Higher Score''' is a [[No Continues]] stage in '''Challenge Battle''', a mini-game unlocked after completing Chapter 1 of [[Empire of Cats]]. Two new enemies debut here: [[Shy Boy]] and [[Assassin Bear]]. It had its own button in the [[Main Menu]] until [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]], when it was temporarily removed from the game. As of [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]], Challenge Battle is found at the end of the "Special Stages" list in [[Legend Stages]].

