==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**8 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 85% HP:
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**1 [[The Face]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 10% HP:
**1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
To someone who has just finished [[Empire of Cats]], this stage shouldn't be that difficult.

At the beginning of the stage, make sure to not shoot the Cat Cannon until you see the Assassin Bear come out, as the Cannon will likely be your only method of killing the Assassin Bear. Deal with the other enemies using strong area attackers such as [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]], and you'll beat the stage eventually.

