==Trivia==
*From [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]] up until it was removed in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]], a header for stages called "Feats of Strength" existed in the files, presumably meant for this stage. It was likely removed because no other stages were made for the category.
*Before it was moved to Legend Stages, Challenge Battle's unit costs were the same as in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 (50% less than usual).
*When [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]] released, Challenge Battle could very briefly be found above the original [[Catfruit]] stages before they were replaced by [[Growing Catfruit]].
*Challenge Battle is one of the oldest stages in the entire game, having existed ever since the original flip phone version of the game, [[Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou]].
*Challenge Battle was the only stage to appear in both Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou and [[Kumanchu Royale]], albeit with different enemies in each game.
*Challenge Battle can be considered the first stage in the game to contain a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy, although [[Assassin Bear]] was originally [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]].
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], this stage was simply called "Challenge".
*Despite being present in both [[The Battle Cats POP!]] and mobile versions, Challenge Battle is absent from [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], though it appears in the game files as the 49th stage in each Main Chapter.

